  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated detection and management of the Southern Rice Black-Streaked Dwarf Virus (SRBSDV) in Guizhou Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed TCP project aims to introduce a new model for early diagnosis and integrated management of &quot;Southern rice black-streaked dwarf virus&quot; (SRBSDV) disease and its vectors (Sogatella furcifera; Laodelphax striatellus) with a comprehensive extension approach that is better suited to improve income and livelihood of rice farmers in poverty-stricken mountainous areas of Libo and Tianzhu counties in Guizhou Province, China.</narrative>
  </description>
